  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Materials for children affected by war &amp; drought</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is to help 10,000 students in Amhara and Afar Region, who cannot continue their education due to war and drought, buy and give them educational materials such as notebooks, pens, pencils, bags etc.  Due to the conflict in the regions Nearly 2.7 million children, nearly half girls, are out of school.</narrative>
